# P0 foundation typecheck + lexer smoke run.
# `haxe pinescript-check.hxml`  → compiles the pinescript sub-package and runs
# the lexer smoke test on Node. As the parser/lowering land this grows into the
# full pinescript test suite (see musescript/pinescript/DESIGN.md build phases).
-cp .
-cp vendor
-D hscriptPos
-main musescript.pinescript.tests.PineLexSmoke
-lib hxnodejs
-D node
-D js_es=6
-js build/js/pinescript-check.js
